"ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-esr102 repo-update HSTS HPKP remote-settings - a=repo-update, r=dsmith\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D163204", "files": ["security/manager/ssl/StaticHPKPins.h", "security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.inc", "services/settings/dumps/security-state/intermediates.json"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "dbec46af57a34ad0f1f9026d97a7fe1a17aaae85", "parents": ["816f414bf86524ddcd75046315da4d5ed79f23b4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "sotaro \u003csotaro.ikeda.g@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1782219 - patch of D121045 for ESR102, a=dsmith\n\nESR102 does not have Bug 1785738 fix. Then the path is changed as to use StaticMutex sVideoBridgeMutex. The lock usage is as same as D121045's usage.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D162938", "files": ["gfx/layers/ipc/VideoBridgeParent.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "2024f55f8799d346581069d4d09b7e77ff9addd8", "parents": ["dbec46af57a34ad0f1f9026d97a7fe1a17aaae85"], "tags": []}], "date": 1669642628, "git_changesets": [null, null], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "123": {"changesets": [{"author": "Valentin Gosu \u003cvalentin.gosu@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1780094 - Add diagnostic asserts that ProxyAutoConfig::SetRunning is called at the correct times. r=kershaw, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D157199", "files": ["netwerk/base/ProxyAutoConfig.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "44a89d647667569a90e2edfbb05158db8dac25e5", "parents": ["2024f55f8799d346581069d4d09b7e77ff9addd8"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mike Hommey \u003cmh@glandium.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1773259 - Work around build failure with newer cbindgen. r=emilio, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D162262", "files": [